cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "WCCC — World Contribution Circulation Council"
abstract: >-
  An international standard proposal for AI safety, contribution circulation,
  and non-hegemonic AI governance. Includes the record-layer design: a
  two-layer ledger in which contribution records generate no claims, and
  claims, where they exist, carry a declared terminus.
type: software
